# Business Membership Roles (Permanent)

## Law

Every Business has **members** with exactly one role. Cross-business access is forbidden — always authorize via path `:businessId` + `business_memberships`.

## Locked roles

| Role | Code | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Owner | `OWNER` | Billing, backup/restore, delete business, invite any non-owner role, manage all members |
| Admin | `ADMIN` | Settings, members (Editor/Viewer), audit, document approve/publish |
| Editor | `EDITOR` | Manage data / templates / assets / themes / documents + enqueue PDF |
| Viewer | `VIEWER` | Read-only membership |

Canonical enum: `MembershipRole` in `@vdb/shared-types` **and** Prisma (values must match).

**Removed:** `MEMBER` — migrate historical rows to `EDITOR`.

## Fine-grained permissions (P04-T02)

Membership RBAC is **separate** from subscription **module entitlements** (`module.map`, `export.pdf`, …). Both must pass when a route needs both.

Stable codes (`MembershipPermissionCodes`):

| Code | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `manage.data` | Corporate content mutate (projects, team, …) + import |
| `manage.templates` | Template CRUD |
| `manage.assets` | Media + fonts upload/delete |
| `manage.themes` | Design themes mutate |
| `manage.documents` | Document/version/comment mutate + submit-review |
| `rbac.export.pdf` | Enqueue PDF (still needs entitlement `export.pdf`) |
| `documents.publish` | Approve / reject / publish / unpublish / reopen |
| `manage.settings` | Rename business |
| `manage.members` | Invite / role change / remove |
| `manage.billing` | Platform checkout |
| `manage.backup` | Workspace backup/restore |
| `audit.read` | Audit log list |

